    <h1>Privacy Policy for Motivational Dream</h1>
    <p>Last Updated: 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>Welcome to Motivational Dream! This privacy policy explains how we handle information in relation to your experience with the app. Please read it carefully to understand our practices.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Motivational Dream does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or share any personal or non-personal information from our users. The app is designed to be used without the need to provide any personal data. Any saved favorite quotes, mood preferences, and app state are stored locally on your device and are never transmitted to our servers or shared with third parties.</p>

    <h2>3. Home Screen and Lock Screen Widgets</h2>
    <p>Motivational Dream offers optional Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets that display inspirational quotes. The widgets read data stored locally on your device and show a new quote each time they refresh, without requiring an internet connection or opening the app. Mood preferences stay in sync between the app and the widgets through on-device storage only. Tapping a widget opens the app; no data is sent to external servers.</p>

    <h2>4. Apple Watch App</h2>
    <p>Motivational Dream includes an Apple Watch companion app that displays the same quotes as the iPhone app. The watch app reads locally stored data on your device and works without an internet connection. No quote or usage data is transmitted from your Apple Watch to our servers or to third parties.</p>

    <h2>5. Sharing and Copying Quotes</h2>
    <p>When you share or copy a quote, Motivational Dream uses your device's built-in share sheet or clipboard (such as Messages, Mail, or social apps). We do not receive, store, or have access to any content you share or copy through these services. Any data handled by third-party apps you choose to share with is governed by their own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>6. Quote Content</h2>
    <p>All nearly 3,000 quotes and affirmations in Motivational Dream are bundled with the app and available offline across four moods: Motivation &amp; Success, Calm &amp; Mindfulness, Dreams &amp; Possibility, and Resilience &amp; Strength. We do not fetch or download quotes from the internet at runtime, and the app does not contain, show, or access third-party content.</p>

    <h2>7. No Ads, No Account, No Tracking</h2>
    <p>Motivational Dream is a privacy-focused app that operates completely offline. The app does not display advertisements, does not require user accounts or registration, does not track you, and does not need an internet connection to function. All your data stays on your device.</p>

    <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. Since the app does not collect any data, it is safe for use by children under the guidelines of the Children's Online Privacy Protection Rule (COPPA). Motivational Dream is designed for users of all ages.</p>

    <h2>9. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
    <p>Since we do not collect any personal information, there are no user data rights or choices applicable within the app. All app data, including saved favorites and mood preferences, are stored locally on your device and can be cleared by uninstalling the app.</p>

    <h2>10. Security</h2>
    <p>While the app does not collect or store personal data, we ensure that any future update that might involve data collection will prioritize user data security and comply with applicable data protection laws.</p>

    <h2>11. Changes to Our Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>Any changes to our privacy policy will be posted on this page. Users are encouraged to review our privacy policy periodically to stay informed about how we are helping to protect the personal information we collect.</p>

    <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: contact@oanarinaldi.com</p>

